Draw the complete processing section diagram for the following register transfer description indicating all the control points, inputs and outputs. List out the control points and the operation performed.

Declare registers A[4], M[4], Q[4], L[3], C[1]
Declare buses inbus[4], outbus[4]
Start: A←0, C←0, M←inbus, L←4;

Q←inbus
Loop: if Q[0]= 1, then go to ADD
Go to Rshift;
ADD: A←A+M;
Rshift: LSR(C$A$Q), L←L-1;
if L>0, then go to Loop
outbus ←A;
outbus←Q;
Halt: Go to Halt
